{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019033043857-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019073204\"/><p>現場為河內道18號一商場對開。</p><p>尖沙咀有人遇襲。今日(19日)凌晨2時59分，一名姓宋(20歲)男子報案，指自己在河內道18號一商場對開遭兩名男子以手襲擊，兩人其後離去。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，案件列「襲擊致造成身體傷害」跟進，暫未有人被捕。宋男臉部受傷，清醒被送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T23:38:42.262413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:30:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T00:57:41.914114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T23:37:39.301815+00:00","content_hash":"24e644f60b59bc83979da0d7ed9568dba69e8552d55d95a0d9a88ec3ebaab582","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}